#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:2
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:4
msgid ""
"Provisioning Instances and Apps typically involves many steps beyond "
"starting a workload. |morpheus| is centered around automating everything "
"desired for your application to be fully operational, including "
"networking, storage, hostnames, domains, dns, licenses, "
"scripts/automation, scaling, load balancers, security, accessibility, "
"governance, auditing, monitoring, backups, costs, sizing and on and on. "
"Point being there is a lot that goes on when spinning up an instance or "
"app, and to make the magic happen a few requirements need to be met."
msgstr "El aprovisionamiento de Instancias y Aplicaciones típicamente involucra muchos pasos más allá de iniciar una carga de trabajo. |morpheus| se centra en automatizar todo lo necesario para que su aplicación esté completamente operativa, incluyendo redes, almacenamiento, nombres de host, dominios, DNS, licencias, scripts/automatización, escalado, balanceadores de carga, seguridad, accesibilidad, gobernanza, auditoría, monitoreo, backups, costos, dimensionamiento y mucho más. El punto es que hay mucho que sucede al iniciar una instancia o aplicación, y para que la magia ocurra se deben cumplir algunos requisitos."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:6
msgid ""
"By default, Agent Installation is enabled when provisioning unless "
"deselected on the Virtual Images or `SKIP AGENT INSTALL` is selected when"
" provisioning."
msgstr "De forma predeterminada, la instalación del agente está habilitada al aprovisionar, a menos que se deseleccione en las imágenes virtuales o se seleccione `SKIP AGENT INSTALL` durante el aprovisionamiento."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:9
msgid "VM Provision Steps"
msgstr "Pasos de aprovisionamiento de VM"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:11
msgid ""
"While an infinite number of steps can happen when provisioning an "
"Instance or App using VM(s) in |morpheus|, the basic order is:"
msgstr "Si bien puede ocurrir un número infinito de pasos al aprovisionar una Instancia o Aplicación usando VM(s) en |morpheus|, el orden básico es:"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:13
msgid "Look for Virtual Image"
msgstr "Buscar imagen virtual"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:15
msgid ""
"|morpheus| will check if the Virtual Image set on the Node Type or "
"selected during provisioning is already available in the source Cloud. If"
" not and it is an Uploaded/Local Image, |morpheus| will attempt to upload"
" the Image to the target Cloud."
msgstr "|morpheus| verificará si la imagen virtual configurada en el Tipo de nodo o seleccionada durante el aprovisionamiento ya está disponible en la Nube de origen. Si no lo está y es una imagen subida/local, |morpheus| intentará subir la imagen a la Nube objetivo."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:17
msgid "**Upload Image**"
msgstr "**Subir imagen**"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:19
msgid ""
"For Uploaded/Local Images that do not exist in the target cloud, "
"|morpheus| will need to upload the Image. Ensure the Virtual Image is "
"valid for the target Cloud, the Image meets the target cloud upload "
"requirements, and |morpheus| has network access and permissions to upload"
" the image."
msgstr "Para imágenes subidas/locales que no existen en la nube objetivo, |morpheus| necesitará subir la imagen. Asegúrese de que la imagen virtual sea válida para la Nube objetivo, que la imagen cumpla los requisitos de carga de la nube objetivo y que |morpheus| tenga acceso de red y permisos para subir la imagen."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:21
#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:130
msgid ""
"When uploading an image to a VMware Cloud, the Virtual Image is copied "
"directly to the target ESXi host, NOT through the vCenter server. Ensure "
"the |morpheus| Appliance(s) can resolve target ESXi hostnames and connect"
" on port 443 for successful vmdk/ova uploads."
msgstr "Al subir una imagen a una Nube VMware, la imagen virtual se copia directamente al host ESXi objetivo, NO a través del servidor vCenter. Asegúrese de que el/los Appliance(s) de |morpheus| puedan resolver los nombres de host ESXi objetivo y conectarse en el puerto 443 para cargas exitosas de vmdk/ova."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:23
msgid "**Clone Image**"
msgstr "**Clonar imagen**"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:25
msgid ""
"Once the Image is confirmed available in the target cloud, |morpheus| "
"will clone the Image to the target Datastore."
msgstr "Una vez confirmada la disponibilidad de la imagen en la nube objetivo, |morpheus| clonará la imagen al Datastore objetivo."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:27
msgid "The target host must have access to the target Datastore of the Image"
msgstr "El host objetivo debe tener acceso al Datastore objetivo de la imagen"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:29
msgid "Reconfigure Image"
msgstr "Reconfigurar imagen"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:31
msgid ""
"Once cloned, |morpheus| will resize the Image based off provisioning "
"parameters"
msgstr "Una vez clonada, |morpheus| redimensionará la imagen según los parámetros de aprovisionamiento"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:36
msgid "Cloud-init (if enabled)"
msgstr "Cloud-init (si está habilitado)"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:34
msgid "Attached cloud-init iso"
msgstr "ISO de cloud-init adjunto"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:35
msgid ""
"When using cloud-init, |morpheus| will attach a tiny metadata iso to the "
"new VM. Network, Machine, User and any other cloud-init metadata will be "
"sourced from this iso."
msgstr "Al usar cloud-init, |morpheus| adjuntará un pequeño ISO de metadatos a la nueva VM. La red, máquina, usuario y cualquier otro metadato de cloud-init se obtendrá de este ISO."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:36
msgid "VM Tools"
msgstr "VM Tools"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:37
msgid ""
"|morpheus| will run Guest Customizations via VMware VM Tools, including "
"network config when assigning static IP's."
msgstr "|morpheus| ejecutará las personalizaciones de invitado a través de VMware VM Tools, incluyendo la configuración de red al asignar IPs estáticas."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:38
msgid "Wait for Power On status and Network info"
msgstr "Esperar estado de encendido e información de red"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:40
msgid ""
"|morpheus| will wait to hear back from the target cloud/hypervisor that "
"the VM has successfully started and has an IP address."
msgstr "|morpheus| esperará la confirmación de la nube/hipervisor objetivo de que la VM se ha iniciado exitosamente y tiene una dirección IP."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:44
msgid ""
"If ``VM TOOLS INSTALLED?`` is NOT checked on the source Virtual Image "
"configuration, |morpheus| will skip waiting for network."
msgstr "Si ``VM TOOLS INSTALLED?`` NO está marcado en la configuración de la imagen virtual de origen, |morpheus| omitirá la espera de red."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:46
msgid "Finalize"
msgstr "Finalizar"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:48
msgid ""
"By default this will include Agent Installation and any post-provision "
"scripts or workflows or integration automation steps."
msgstr "De forma predeterminada, esto incluirá la instalación del agente y cualquier script post-aprovisionamiento, flujos de trabajo o pasos de automatización de integración."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:50
msgid ""
"If the VM is stuck in finalize for longs periods of time, this typically "
"means the Agent cannot be installed or has not been heard back from. This"
" will result in a `!` warning Instance status upon provisioning "
"completion."
msgstr "Si la VM está atascada en la fase de finalización durante largos períodos de tiempo, típicamente significa que el agente no puede ser instalado o no se ha recibido respuesta. Esto resultará en un estado de Instancia con advertencia `!` al completar el aprovisionamiento."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:52
msgid ""
"If agent installation is not possible or desired, uncheck \"Install "
"Agent\" on the source Virtual Image configuration or select \"Skip Agent "
"Install\" during provisioning to speed up provisioning completion."
msgstr ""
"Si agent installation es no possible o desired, uncheck \"Instalar Agent\" "
"en el/la source Virtual Imagen configuración o seleccionar \"Skip Agent "
"Instalar\" durante aprovisionamiento a speed up aprovisionamiento "
"completion."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:55
msgid "Virtual Images"
msgstr "Imágenes virtuales"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:57
msgid ""
"While containers are the future, the most common provisioning method "
"involves Virtual Machines, and the most important part of Provisioning a "
"VM is the Virtual Image. When provisioning a VM, |morpheus| will need to "
"do a few things depending on the location of the Virtual Image and if "
"agent install, console access, and script execution is desired."
msgstr "Aunque los contenedores son el futuro, el método de aprovisionamiento más común involucra máquinas virtuales, y la parte más importante del aprovisionamiento de una VM es la imagen virtual. Al aprovisionar una VM, |morpheus| necesitará hacer varias cosas dependiendo de la ubicación de la imagen virtual y si se desea la instalación del agente, acceso a consola y ejecución de scripts."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:59
msgid "Synced Images need to be properly configured"
msgstr "Las imágenes sincronizadas deben estar configuradas correctamente"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:60
msgid ""
"|morpheus| gathers as much metadata for synced images as possible, but "
"depending on the cloud, os, image configuration, agent install settings, "
"by default the synced Virtual Images may not be ready to provision until "
"configured. The Virtual Image is already at the target Cloud, but "
"datastore selection, credentials, cloud-init settings, and networks and "
"security settings on the Virtual Image can cause provisioning issues."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| gathers as much metadata para synced imágenes as possible, pero "
"depending en el/la cloud, os, imagen configuración, agent instalar "
"configuración, de forma predeterminada el/la synced Virtual Imágenes puede "
"no be ready a provision until configurado. El/La Virtual Imagen es already "
"en el/la target Cloud, pero datastore selection, credentials, cloud-init "
"configuración, y networks y security configuración en el/la Virtual Imagen "
"puede cause aprovisionamiento issues."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:61
msgid "Local/Uploaded Virtual Images"
msgstr "Imágenes virtuales locales/subidas"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:62
msgid ""
"Images uploaded to |morpheus| are configured during the `Add Virtual "
"Image` process, however |morpheus| in most scenarios will still need to "
"copy the Virtual Image to the target Hypervisor/Cloud upon the first "
"provision to the target Cloud. In addition to the requirements for "
"provisioning a synced Virtual Image, copying an uploaded Virtual Image to"
" the target Cloud is required and network and image configurations can "
"cause upload failures, resulting in provisioning issues."
msgstr ""
"Imágenes uploaded a |morpheus| son configurado durante el/la `Add Virtual "
"Image` proceso, sin embargo |morpheus| en most scenarios será still need a "
"copiar el/la Virtual Imagen a el/la target Hypervisor/Cloud upon el/la "
"first provision a el/la target Cloud. Además a el/la requisitos para "
"aprovisionamiento un synced Virtual Imagen, copying un uploaded Virtual "
"Imagen a el/la target Cloud es necesario y network y imagen configuraciones "
"puede cause upload failures, resulting en aprovisionamiento issues."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:64
msgid "Marketplace Images"
msgstr "Imágenes del marketplace"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:64
msgid ""
"AWS and Azure marketplace Images can be provisioned using the generic "
"Amazon or Azure Instance Types, or added as Virtual Images as scoped to "
"Node Types for custom Instance Types. Marketplace items provisioned/added"
" to |morpheus| still fall upon the requirements of the target Cloud, such"
" as matching the region with the Image and licensing."
msgstr ""
"AWS y Azure marketplace Imágenes puede ser provisioned using el/la generic "
"Amazon o Azure Instancia Tipos, o added as Virtual Imágenes as scoped a "
"Tipos de nodo para custom Instancia Tipos. Marketplace elementos "
"provisioned/added a |morpheus| still fall upon el/la requisitos de el/la "
"target Cloud, como matching el/la region con el/la Imagen y licensing."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:67
msgid "Synced Images"
msgstr "Imágenes sincronizadas"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:69
msgid ""
"When a Cloud is added to |morpheus|, all available Images/Templates "
"records from that Cloud will be synced in regardless of Inventory "
"settings on the Cloud. These Image records will be available in the "
"Virtual Images section and can be provisioned by using the target clouds "
"generic Instance Type, ie VMware, Amazon, Azure, Openstack etc Instance "
"Types, or by creating custom Instance Types and selecting the Image on a "
"Node Type."
msgstr ""
"Cuando un Cloud es added a |morpheus|, todos disponible Imágenes/Plantillas "
"records desde que Cloud será synced en regardless de Inventory "
"configuración en el/la Cloud. Estos Imagen records será disponible en el/la "
"Virtual Imágenes sección y puede ser provisioned por using el/la target "
"clouds generic Instancia Tipo, ie VMware, Amazon, Azure, Openstack etc "
"Instancia Tipos, o por creating custom Instancia Tipos y selecting el/la "
"Imagen en un Tipos de nodo."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:71
msgid ""
"Synced Virtual Images are just meta-data records in |morpheus| pointing "
"to the Image in the target Cloud. The actual Image files are not "
"copied/imported to |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"Synced Virtual Imágenes son just meta-data records en |morpheus| pointing a "
"el/la Imagen en el/la target Cloud. El/La actual Imagen archivos son no "
"copied/importado a |morpheus|."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:73
msgid ""
"Before provisioning a synced Virtual Images, ensure the image is "
"configured properly:"
msgstr ""
"Before aprovisionamiento a synced Virtual Images, ensure the image está "
"configurado properly:"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:75
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nombre"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:76
msgid ""
"Name of the Virtual Image in |morpheus|. This can be changed from the "
"name of the Image, but editing will not change the name of the actual "
"Image."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de el/la Virtual Imagen en |morpheus|. Este puede ser changed desde "
"el/la nombre de el/la Imagen, pero editing será no change el/la nombre de "
"el/la actual Imagen."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:77
msgid "Operating System"
msgstr "Sistema operativo"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:78
msgid ""
"Specifies the Platform and OS of the image. All Windows images will need "
"to have Operating System specified on the  Virtual Image, as |morpheus| "
"will assign Linux as the Platform for all Images without Operating System"
" specified."
msgstr ""
"Specifies el/la Platform y OS de el/la imagen. Todos Windows imágenes "
"necesitará tienen Operating System especificado en el/la  Virtual Imagen, "
"as |morpheus| será assign Linux as el/la Platform para todos Imágenes "
"without Operating System especificado."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:79
msgid "Minimum Memory"
msgstr "Memoria mínima"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:80
msgid ""
"The Minimum Memory setting will filter available Service Plans options "
"during provisioning. Service Plans that do not meet the Minimum Memory "
"value set on the Virtual Image will not be provided as Service Plan "
"choices."
msgstr ""
"El/La Minimum Memory setting será filter disponible Service Plans opciones "
"durante aprovisionamiento. Service Plans que hacer no meet el/la Minimum "
"Memory valor establecer en el/la Virtual Imagen será no be provided as "
"Service Plan choices."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:84
msgid "Cloud Init Enabled?"
msgstr "¿Cloud-Init habilitado?"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:82
msgid ""
"On by default, uncheck for any Image that does not have Cloud-Init or "
"Cloudbase-Init installed."
msgstr ""
"En de forma predeterminada, uncheck para cualquier Imagen que hace no "
"tienen Cloud-Init o Cloudbase-Init installed."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:84
#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:119
msgid ""
"Provisioning a Virtual Image that has `Cloud Init Enabled?` checked on "
"the Virtual Record in |morpheus| but does not have cloud-init installed "
"will result in immediate provisioning failure."
msgstr ""
"Aprovisionamiento un Virtual Imagen que tiene `Cloud Init Enabled?` checked "
"en el/la Virtual Record en |morpheus| pero hace no tienen cloud-init "
"installed será resultado en immediate aprovisionamiento failure."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:86
msgid "Install Agent"
msgstr "Instalar agente"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:87
msgid ""
"On by default, uncheck to skip Agent install. Note this will result in "
"the loss of utilization statistics, logs, script execution, and "
"monitoring. (Some utilization stats are collected for agent-less hosts "
"and vm's from VMware and AWS clouds)."
msgstr ""
"En de forma predeterminada, uncheck a skip Agent instalar. Note este será "
"resultado en el/la loss de utilization statistics, logs, script ejecución, "
"y monitoring. (Some utilization stats son collected para agent-less hosts y "
"vm's desde VMware y AWS clouds)."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:88
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Nombre de usuario"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:89
msgid ""
"Existing Username on the Image. This is required for authentication, "
"unless |morpheus| is able to add user data, Cloud-Init, Cloudbase-Init or"
" Guest Customizations. If Cloud-Init, Cloudbase-Init Guest Customizations"
" or Nutanix Sysprep are used, credentials are defined in |AdmSetPro| and "
"User Settings. If credentials are defined on the Image and Cloud-Init is "
"enabled, |morpheus| will add that user during provisioning, so ensure "
"that user does not already exist in the image (aka ``root``). For Windows"
" Guest Customizations, |morpheus| will set the Administrator password to "
"what is defined on the image if Administrator user is defined. Do not "
"define any other user than Administrator for Windows Images unless using "
"Cloudbase-init. |morpheus| recommends running Guest Customizations for "
"all Windows Images, which is required when joining Domains as the SID "
"will change."
msgstr ""
"Existing Username en el/la Imagen. Este es necesario para authentication, "
"unless |morpheus| es able a agregar usuario data, Cloud-Init, "
"Cloudbase-Init o Guest Customizations. Si Cloud-Init, Cloudbase-Init Guest "
"Customizations o Nutanix Sysprep son used, credentials son defined en "
"|AdmSetPro| y Usuario Settings. Si credentials son defined en el/la Imagen "
"y Cloud-Init está habilitado, |morpheus| será agregar que usuario durante "
"aprovisionamiento, so asegúrese de que usuario hace no already exist en "
"el/la imagen (aka ``root``). Para Windows Guest Customizations, |morpheus| "
"será establecer el/la Administrator password a qué es defined en el/la "
"imagen si Administrator usuario es defined. Hacer no define cualquier otro "
"usuario than Administrator para Windows Imágenes unless using "
"Cloudbase-init. |morpheus| recommends running Guest Customizations para "
"todos Windows Imágenes, cual es necesario cuando joining Domains as el/la "
"SID será change."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:90
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Contraseña"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:91
msgid "Password for the Existing User on the image if Username is populated."
msgstr ""
"Password para el/la Existing Usuario en el/la imagen si Username es "
"populated."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:92
msgid "Storage Provider"
msgstr "Proveedor de almacenamiento"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:93
msgid ""
"Location where the Virtual Image will be stored. Default Virtual Image "
"Storage location is /var/opt/morpheus/morpheus-ui/VMs. Additional Storage"
" Providers can be configured in |InfSto|."
msgstr ""
"Location where the Virtual Image será stored. Default Virtual Image Storage "
"location is /var/opt/morpheus/morpheus-ui/VMs. Additional Storage Providers "
"puede ser configured in |InfSto|."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:94
msgid "Cloud-Init User Data"
msgstr "Datos de usuario de Cloud-Init"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:95
msgid ""
"Accepts what would go in runcmd and can assume bash syntax. Example use: "
"Script to configure satellite registration at provision time."
msgstr ""
"Accepts qué would go en runcmd y puede assume bash syntax. Ejemplo usar: "
"Script a configurar satellite registration en provision time."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:104
msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "Permisos"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:104
msgid ""
"Set Tenant permissions in a multi-tenant |morpheus| environment. No "
"impact on single-tenant environments."
msgstr "Configure los permisos de Inquilino en un entorno multi-inquilino de |morpheus|. Sin impacto en entornos de un solo inquilino."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:101
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "Visibilidad"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:99
msgid "Private"
msgstr "Privado"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:100
msgid "Image is only available in the specified Tenants below."
msgstr "La imagen solo está disponible en los Inquilinos especificados a continuación."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:101
msgid "Public"
msgstr "Público"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:102
msgid "Image is available to all Tenants."
msgstr "La imagen está disponible para todos los Inquilinos."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:104
msgid "Tenant"
msgstr "Inquilino"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:104
msgid ""
"If Visibility is set to Private, specify Tenants the Image will be "
"available for."
msgstr "Si la visibilidad está configurada como Privado, especifique los Inquilinos para los cuales estará disponible la imagen."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:106
msgid "Auto Join Domain?"
msgstr "¿Unión automática al dominio?"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:107
msgid ""
"Enable to have Instances provisioned with this image auto-join configured"
" domains (Windows only, domain controller must be configured in |InfNet| "
"and the configured domain set on the provisioned to Cloud or Network)."
msgstr ""
"Habilitar a tienen Instancias provisioned con este imagen auto-join "
"configurado domains (Windows solo, domain controller debe ser configurado "
"en |InfNet| y el/la configurado domain establecer en el/la provisioned a "
"Cloud o Network)."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:108
msgid "VirtIO Drivers Loaded?"
msgstr "¿Controladores VirtIO cargados?"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:109
msgid ""
"Enable if VirtIO Drivers are installed on the image for provisioning to "
"KVM based Hypervisors."
msgstr ""
"Enable if VirtIO Drivers are installed on the image for aprovisionamiento "
"to KVM based Hypervisors."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:110
msgid "VM Tools Installed?"
msgstr "¿VM Tools instalado?"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:111
msgid ""
"On by default, uncheck if VMware Tools (including OpenVMTools) are not "
"installed on the Virtual Image. |morpheus| will skip network wait during "
"provisioning when deselected."
msgstr ""
"En de forma predeterminada, uncheck si VMware Tools (including OpenVMTools) "
"son no installed en el/la Virtual Imagen. |morpheus| será skip network wait "
"durante aprovisionamiento cuando deselected."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:112
msgid "Force Guest Customization?"
msgstr "¿Forzar personalización de invitado?"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:113
msgid ""
"VMware only, forces guest customizations to run during provisioning, "
"typically when provisioning to a DHCP network where guest customizations "
"would not run by default. This is required for host/computer name "
"definitions. domain joining, licenses and user definitions when using "
"DHCP."
msgstr ""
"VMware solo, forces guest customizations a ejecutar durante "
"aprovisionamiento, typically cuando aprovisionamiento a un DHCP network "
"donde guest customizations would no ejecutar de forma predeterminada. Este "
"es necesario para host/computer nombre definitions. domain joining, "
"licenses y usuario definitions cuando using DHCP."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:114
msgid "Trial Version"
msgstr "Versión de prueba"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:115
msgid ""
"Enable to automatically re-arm the expiration on Windows Trial Images "
"during provisioning."
msgstr ""
"Enable to automáticamente re-arm the expiration on Windows Trial Images "
"during aprovisionamiento."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:117
msgid "Enabled Sysprep?"
msgstr "¿Sysprep habilitado?"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:117
msgid ""
"Applicable to Nutanix Only. Enable if the Windows Image has been "
"sysprepped. If enabled, |morpheus| will inject Unattend.xml through the "
"Nutanix API (v3+ only)"
msgstr ""
"Applicable a Nutanix Solo. Habilitar si el/la Windows Imagen ha sido "
"sysprepped. Si habilitado, |morpheus| será inject Unattend.xml a través de "
"el/la Nutanix API (v3+ solo)"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:121
msgid ""
"For Linux images without cloud-Init, an existing username and password "
"must be defined on the Virtual Image record for Agent Install, Domain "
"joining, licensing, script execution and other automation, and SSH or RDP"
" Console access."
msgstr ""
"Para Linux imágenes without cloud-Init, un existente username y password "
"debe ser defined en el/la Virtual Imagen record para Agent Instalar, Domain "
"joining, licensing, script ejecución y otro automation, y SSH o RDP Console "
"acceso."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:125
msgid "Local Virtual Images"
msgstr "Imágenes virtuales locales"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:126
msgid ""
"A Local Virtual Image means it has been uploaded to |morpheus|.  To "
"provision, |morpheus| will need to upload the Image to the target Cloud "
"upon first provision."
msgstr ""
"A Local Virtual Image means it ha sido uploaded to |morpheus|.  To "
"provision, |morpheus| necesitará upload the Image to the target Cloud upon "
"first provision."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:128
msgid ""
"Ensure the Virtual Image is valid for the target Cloud, the Image meets "
"the target cloud upload requirements, and |morpheus| has network access "
"and permissions to upload the image."
msgstr ""
"Ensure el/la Virtual Imagen es valid para el/la target Cloud, el/la Imagen "
"meets el/la target cloud upload requisitos, y |morpheus| tiene network "
"acceso y permisos a upload el/la imagen."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:132
msgid ""
"Once a Local Virtual Image has been uploaded to a Cloud, subsequent "
"provisions will use the Image local to the cloud instead of uploading "
"again as long as the copied image is still available in the source Cloud."
msgstr ""
"Once un Local Virtual Imagen ha sido uploaded a un Cloud, subsequent "
"provisions será usar el/la Imagen local a el/la cloud instead de uploading "
"again as long as el/la copied imagen es still disponible en el/la source "
"Cloud."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:135
msgid "Agent Install"
msgstr "Instalación del agente"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:137
msgid ""
"When provisioning an instance, there are some network and configuration "
"requirements to successfully install the morpheus agent.  Typically when "
"a vm instance is still in the provisioning phase long after the vm is up,"
" the instance is unable to reach |morpheus|, or depending on agent "
"install mode, |morpheus| is unable to reach the instance."
msgstr ""
"Cuando aprovisionamiento un instancia, there son some network y "
"configuración requisitos a exitosamente instalar el/la morpheus agent.  "
"Typically cuando un vm instancia es still en el/la aprovisionamiento phase "
"long después de el/la vm es up, el/la instancia es unable a reach "
"|morpheus|, o depending en agent instalar mode, |morpheus| es unable a "
"reach el/la instancia."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:139
msgid ""
"The most common reason an agent install fails is the provisioned instance"
" cannot reach the |morpheus| Appliance via the appliance_url set in "
"|AdmSet| over both 443 and 80. When an instance is provisioned from "
"|morpheus|, it must be able to reach the |morpheus| appliance via the "
"appliance_url or the Agent will not be installed."
msgstr ""
"El/La most common reason un agent instalar fails es el/la provisioned "
"instancia cannot reach el/la |morpheus| Appliance via el/la appliance_url "
"establecer en |AdmSet| sobre both 443 y 80. Cuando un instancia es "
"provisioned desde |morpheus|, it debe ser able a reach el/la |morpheus| "
"appliance via el/la appliance_url o el/la Agent será no be installed."

msgid ".. image:: images/agent-7c9a2.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/agent-7c9a2.png"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:145
msgid ""
"In addition to the main appliance_url in |AdmSet|, additional "
"appliance_urls can be set per cloud in the Advanced options of the cloud "
"configuration pane when creating or editing a cloud. When this field is "
"populated, it will override the main appliance url for anything "
"provisioned into that cloud."
msgstr ""
"Además a el/la main appliance_url en |AdmSet|, adicional appliance_urls "
"puede ser establecer per cloud en el/la Advanced opciones de el/la cloud "
"configuración pane cuando creating o editing un cloud. Cuando este campo es "
"populated, it será override el/la main appliance url para anything "
"provisioned en que cloud."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:147
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| UI current log, located at /var/log/morpheus/morpheus-"
"ui/current, is very helpful when troubleshooting agent installations."
msgstr ""
"El/La |morpheus| UI current log, located en "
"/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/current, es very helpful cuando "
"troubleshooting agent installations."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:150
msgid "Agent Install Modes"
msgstr "Modos de instalación del agente"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:152
msgid "There are 3 Agent install modes:"
msgstr "Hay 3 modos de instalación del agente:"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:154
msgid "ssh/winrm"
msgstr "ssh/winrm"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:155
msgid "VMware Tools"
msgstr "VMware Tools"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:156
msgid "cloud-init"
msgstr "cloud-init"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:159
msgid "For All Agent Install modes"
msgstr "Para todos los modos de instalación del agente"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:161
msgid ""
"When an instance is provisioned and the agent does not install, verify "
"the following for any agent install mode:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando un instancia es provisioned y el/la agent hace no instalar, verify "
"las siguientes para cualquier agent instalar mode:"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:163
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| appliance_url (|AdmSet|) is both reachable and resolvable "
"from the provisioned node."
msgstr ""
"El/La |morpheus| appliance_url (|AdmSet|) es both reachable y resolvable "
"desde el/la provisioned node."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:164
msgid "The appliance_url begins with to ``https://``, not ``http://``."
msgstr "El/La appliance_url begins con a ``https://``, no ``http://``."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:166
msgid ""
"Be sure to use ``https://`` even when using an IP address for the "
"appliance."
msgstr ""
"Be sure a usar ``https://`` even cuando using un IP address para el/la "
"appliance."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:168
msgid ""
"Inbound connectivity access to the |morpheus| Appliance from provisioned "
"VM's and container hosts on port 443 (needed for agent communication)"
msgstr ""
"Inbound connectivity acceso a el/la |morpheus| Appliance desde provisioned "
"VM's y container hosts en port 443 (needed para agent communication)"

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:170
msgid ""
"Private (non-morpheus provided) vm images/templates must have their "
"credentials entered. These can be entered/edited in the |LibVir| section "
"but clicking the Actions dropdown of an image and selecting Edit."
msgstr ""
"Private (non-morpheus provided) vm imágenes/plantillas must tienen their "
"credentials entered. Estos puede ser entered/edited en el/la |LibVir| "
"sección pero clicking el/la Acciones dropdown de un imagen y selecting "
"Editar."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:172
#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:196
msgid "Administrator user is required for Windows agent install."
msgstr "Se requiere el usuario Administrador para la instalación del agente de Windows."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:174
msgid ""
"The instance does not have an IP address assigned. For scenarios without "
"a DHCP server, static IP information must be entered by selecting the "
"Network Type: Static in the Advanced section during provisioning. IP "
"Pools can also be created in the Infrastructure > Networks > IP Pools "
"section and added to clouds network sections for IPAM."
msgstr ""
"El/La instancia hace no tienen un IP address assigned. Para scenarios "
"without un DHCP servidor, static IP información debe ser entered por "
"selecting el/la Network Tipo: Static en el/la Advanced sección durante "
"aprovisionamiento. IP Pools puede also be creado en el/la Infraestructura > "
"Networks > IP Pools sección y added a clouds network secciones para IPAM."

#: ../../provisioning/requirements.rst:176
msgid ""
"DNS is not configured and the node cannot resolve the appliance. If DNS "
"cannot be configured, the IP address of the |morpheus| appliance can be "
"used as the main or cloud appliance."
msgstr ""
"DNS es no configurado y el/la node cannot resolve el/la appliance. Si DNS "
"cannot be configurado, el/la IP address de el/la |morpheus| appliance puede "
"ser utilizado as el/la main o cloud appliance."

